     Changes[0m[2m made[0m[2m:
     1. **[0m[2mcheckout.py**: Re[0m[2mordered the checkout[0m[2m flow to reserve inventory[0m[2m FIRST (`[0m[2mdecrement`), then[0m[2m charge. If the[0m[2m charge fails, the[0m[2m inventory is restored (`[0m[2mincrement`). This eliminates[0m[2m the TO[0m[2mCTOU window[0m[2m where multiple orders[0m[2m could pass[0m[2m a[0m[2m stock check and then[0m[2m all[0m[2m charge before[0m[2m inventory[0m[2m was actually[0m[2m decremented.
