     3[0m[2m. **payments.py[0m[2m**: Added a[0m[2m `_charged[0m[2m_order_ids` set[0m[2m to make `charge[0m[2m` idempotent.[0m[2m If the[0m[2m same `order_id[0m[2m` is[0m[2m passed again[0m[2m,[0m[2m it[0m[2m returns `[0m[2mTrue` without creating[0m[2m a duplicate charge record[0m[2m.
     
     These[0m[2m three changes[0m[2m together fix:[0m[2m
